 "description": "Static facts about an OpenTravel direct-listed hotel, with no check-in or check-out date required: photo gallery, property description, address, facilities (parking, pool, pets and so on), check-in and check-out times, the house cancellation policy, and each room type's description, floor area, capacity, photos and in-room facilities. Carries no prices and no availability \u2014 get_hotel_detail covers those for a specific date range. Takes the propertyId UUID from search results.",
